    "page_text_ocr_zh": "首先有一个苹果。\n接着是三只鸟。\n然后是四个猎人。\n其次是两条虫子。\n下面是五只狗。\n后面是六只熊。\n接下来是七条小船。\n然后是八只乌龟。\n下面是九条鱼。\n另外还有\n好多好多蜜蜂。\n最后是十个蜂窝。",
    "page_text_en": "First, there is one apple.\nThen, there are three birds.\nNext, there are four hunters.\nThen, there are two worms.\nBelow, there are five dogs.\nAfter that, there are six bears.\nNext, there are seven little boats.\nThen, there are eight turtles.\nBelow, there are nine fish.\nAlso, there are\nso many, many bees.\nFinally, there are ten beehives.",
